WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
- You ever seen the 
last scene of "Eight Mile",

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.910
the Eminem movie?
(audience laughter)

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.931
No? Who saw it?

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:08.030
Great.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.582
If you're into 
battle rap the way I am,

00:00:10.582 --> 00:00:12.975
(audience laughter)

00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:15.300
there's a reason that 
Drake is impossible

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.511
to get into a beef with.

00:00:17.511 --> 00:00:18.831
Drake has figured out

00:00:18.831 --> 00:00:20.474
the same thing I've figured out

00:00:20.474 --> 00:00:22.771
and the same thing that Eminem 
figures out in "Eight Mile"

00:00:22.771 --> 00:00:26.762
which is if you put your 
flaws to the forefront,

00:00:26.762 --> 00:00:30.325
you leave nothing 
for the other person.

00:00:30.325 --> 00:00:33.761
You've got so many more strengths

00:00:33.761 --> 00:00:36.270
than you subtle little flaws

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.400
and you're playing 
defense on those flaws

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.001
instead of going all 
offense on your strengths.

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:44.671
That's the truth.

00:00:44.671 --> 00:00:47.700
("Gettin' By" by MadReal)

